WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.960
Thanks social media does not sell homes, think again.

00:02.960 --> 00:06.340
Today's buyers don't just drive by, they scroll.

00:06.340 --> 00:07.800
That's where I capture attention

00:07.800 --> 00:10.140
and convert it into showings and offers.

00:10.140 --> 00:13.580
Each listing follows a plan, pre-listing media,

00:13.580 --> 00:16.420
active outreach and soul celebration.

00:16.420 --> 00:18.720
Social media helps me sell homes faster

00:18.720 --> 00:20.420
and connect to the out-of-town buyers.

00:20.420 --> 00:22.560
More visibility equals more value

00:22.560 --> 00:24.520
and that's exactly what I deliver.

